  <ARTIST name="Chris Rahn" />
  <CASTING_COST cost="{2}{B}{B}{B}" />
  <FLAVOURTEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="en-US"><![CDATA[Hanging on the walls of his lair, the fallen halos cast his depravity in everlasting light.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="fr-FR"><![CDATA[Suspendus aux murs de son repaire, les halos déchus éclairent sa dépravation d'une lumière éternelle.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="es-ES"><![CDATA[Colgando de las paredes de su guarida, los halos caídos muestran su depravación en una luz eterna.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="de-DE"><![CDATA[Die Heiligenscheine der Gefallenen hängen von den Wänden seiner Höhle und tauchen seine Lasterhaftigkeit in ewiges Licht.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="it-IT"><![CDATA[Appese alle pareti della sua tana, le aureole cadute proiettano sulla sua depravazione una luce infinita.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="jp-JA"><![CDATA[ねぐらの壁に吊るされた光輪は、彼の下劣さを永遠の光で照らしている。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ko-KR"><![CDATA[그것의 거처에 걸린 천사의 광륜들은 그의 추악함을 여과 없이 보여준다.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ru-RU"><![CDATA[Развешанные по стенам его логова, сорванные нимбы озаряют его порочность вечным светом.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="pt-BR"><![CDATA[Penduradas nas paredes de seu covil, as auréolas caídas irradiam uma luz eterna sobre sua depravação.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-CN"><![CDATA[无主光晕挂在他巢穴墙上，其不灭光亮映照着他的邪恶。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-HK"><![CDATA[無主光暈掛在他巢穴牆上，其不滅光亮映照著他的邪惡。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
  </FLAVOURTEXT>
